WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:11.208
This is not just any battle.

00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:15.958
If we lose, 

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:18.500
our fanlings will desert us,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.708
and our society—

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:24.708
which is solely based on interest in basketball—

00:00:24.708 --> 00:00:27.166
will crumble around us.

